00:47:07.226 --> 00:47:10.143
You can think your way into stress.

00:47:11.768 --> 00:47:15.768
You can think your way
into misery, frustration.

00:47:19.848 --> 00:47:23.549
There's so much more power in the mind

00:47:23.549 --> 00:47:27.716
than you probably like to
give yourself credit for.

00:47:28.666 --> 00:47:31.074
When you wake up in the morning
after seeing this video,

00:47:31.074 --> 00:47:34.892
I want you to decide to
think happy thoughts.

00:47:34.892 --> 00:47:37.864
And hanging around and consume yourself

00:47:37.864 --> 00:47:42.031
with happy things and people,
and you will find yourself

00:47:43.353 --> 00:47:46.710
feeling like your mood
and your energy is better.

00:47:46.710 --> 00:47:48.750
I'm in the middle of recording right now

00:47:48.750 --> 00:47:52.917
