a release date of 5/5,

00:48:03.092 --> 00:48:06.571
which I hope doesn't get pushed back.

00:48:06.571 --> 00:48:08.269
But I just wanted to take this moment

00:48:08.269 --> 00:48:11.102
in the middle of my studio session

00:48:12.320 --> 00:48:16.403
to tell you how much power
you have in your mind.

00:48:19.741 --> 00:48:22.241
We are all a work in progress.

00:48:23.769 --> 00:48:26.269
We are all a work in progress,

00:48:28.994 --> 00:48:32.416
trying to climb our way
up the spiritual ladder,

00:48:32.416 --> 00:48:35.499
do better, be better, trying our best

00:48:38.491 --> 00:48:42.658
to not put our hands and our
legs on obvious landmines.

00:48:47.723 --> 00:48:49.390
And making mistakes.

00:48:53.687 --> 00:48:55.104
No one's perfect.

00:48:58.763 --> 00:49:02.930
But I just want to remind
you of the power of the mind.

00:49:05.494 --> 00:49:09.661
You can create the outcome
of your hour, your week,

00:49:11.311 --> 00:49:14.100
your month, and your year.

00:49:14.100 --> 00:49:18.267
You just have to decide in your
mind what you want it to be.

00:49:20.771 --> 00:49:24.002
Some of you all are
struggling with depression

00:49:24.002 --> 00:49:26.676
and being sad and just
being in this blue funk

00:49:26.676 --> 00:49:28.593
and you can't shake it.

00:49:30.444 --> 00:49:34.539
I thank God every day that that's not me.

00:49:34.539 --> 00:49:38.622
But I do know and I
recognize that it does exist.

00:49:39.534 --> 00:49:42.367
But there's more power in the mind

00:49:43.641 --> 00:49:45.391
than you probably like to think

00:49:45.391 --> 00:49:47.808
and give yourself credit for.

00:49:49.785 --> 00:49:53.868
If your life and your
surroundings is a nightmare

00:49:54.849 --> 00:49:58.266
while you're awake, those same nightmares

00:49:59.527 --> 00:50:02.444
are going to continue into your sleep.

00:50:03.298 --> 00:50:06.072
Because the mind doesn't turn off

00:50:06.072 --> 00:50:10.239
because you close your eyes
to go to sleep and rest.

00:50:16.143 --> 00:50:19.560
You can think yourself into a depression.

00:50:21.772 --> 00:50:24.562
Keep thinking and replaying and thinking

00:50:24.562 --> 00:50:28.729
and replaying the same over
and over and over in your mind.

00:50:31.494 --> 00:50:35.291
And then your body naturally
will feel the effects

00:50:35.291 --> 00:50:38.291
of what you've created in your mind.

00:50:39.784 --> 00:50:42.196
And a lot of you guys
are on the receiving end

00:50:42.196 --> 00:50:44.087
of something that happened to you,

00:50:44.087 --> 00:50:48.000
a heartbreak, a situation, disrespect,

00:50:48.000 --> 00:50:52.167
feeling vulnerable, feeling
like someone or a situation

00:50:54.055 --> 00:50:57.555
has caused you to be on the receiving end.

00:50:58.479 --> 00:51:00.497
And so you're feeling the effects

00:51:00.497 --> 00:51:03.689
of losing a grandmother, a grandfather,

00:51:03.689 --> 00:51:08.181
a friend, a family member,
a cousin, your best friend.

00:51:08.181 --> 00:51:11.313
Dealing with the trauma and
the psychological effects

00:51:11.313 --> 00:51:15.031
of losing your child, a car accident,

00:51:15.031 --> 00:51:17.655
maybe something that you witnessed.

00:51:17.655 --> 00:51:20.456
And so it's very natural for something

00:51:20.456 --> 00:51:23.300
that you've experienced to replay

00:51:23.300 --> 00:51:26.300
in your mind over and over and over.

00:51:32.209 --> 00:51:36.376
But if you change your mind,
it'll change your life.

00:51:39.965 --> 00:51:43.214
I'm still a work in progress.

00:51:43.214 --> 00:51:44.131
I'm flawed.

00:51:45.483 --> 00:51:49.688
I have my own issues and
problems and situations

00:51:49.688 --> 00:51:51.771
that I'm working through.

00:51:53.595 --> 00:51:58.058
But I do understand clearly
that I'm much more further along

00:51:58.058 --> 00:52:00.135
than a lot of people.

00:52:00.135 --> 00:52:03.028
And so, when I leave my videos,

00:52:03.028 --> 00:52:06.746
I feel like I'm putting my hand out there

00:52:06.746 --> 00:52:10.670
and hoping to relate and
hoping that you can relate

00:52:10.670 --> 00:52:13.361
to what I'm saying and
what I'm speaking on

00:52:13.361 --> 00:52:14.815
because just maybe you're going

00:52:14.815 --> 00:52:17.315
through this exact same thing.

00:52:22.382 --> 00:52:24.330
There's more power in the mind than

00:52:24.330 --> 00:52:26.830
you'd like to give credit for.

00:52:28.608 --> 00:52:32.775
Change your mind, decide
that you love yourself enough

00:52:34.945 --> 00:52:37.093
to not surround yourself with people,

00:52:37.093 --> 00:52:40.367
things, and situations that can have

00:52:40.367 --> 00:52:43.922
your mind continuing to spiral down

00:52:43.922 --> 00:52:47.089
this negative and dysfunctional train.

00:52:50.858 --> 00:52:52.025
Here's a word.

00:52:54.662 --> 00:52:58.829
A word that I got from somebody
that I look up to a lot.

00:53:03.813 --> 00:53:05.480
Be kind to yourself.

00:53:07.331 --> 00:53:10.664
You are actually doing the best you can.

00:53:13.194 --> 00:53:14.861
Be kind to yourself.

00:53:16.607 --> 00:53:19.242
Don't beat yourself up.

00:53:19.242 --> 00:53:22.158
Don't drive yourself crazy.

00:53:22.158 --> 00:53:25.491
You are actually doing the best you can.

00:53:27.779 --> 00:53:32.388
I don't remember the last time
I lost sleep over a hater.

00:53:32.388 --> 00:53:35.648
Because I stopped giving haters permission

00:53:35.648 --> 00:53:39.731
to affect my life, my day,
my month, and my year.

00:53:42.268 --> 00:53:44.906
If someone has something to say

00:53:44.906 --> 00:53:49.469
and it actually makes sense,
you're going to help me to grow,

00:53:49.469 --> 00:53:53.488
mature, consider new
thoughts and feelings,

00:53:53.488 --> 00:53:57.062
views and perspectives that don't exist.

00:53:57.062 --> 00:53:59.885
But for people that go out of their way

00:53:59.885 --> 00:54:03.443
to try and reflect their
negativity and their hate

00:54:03.443 --> 00:54:07.135
and their animosity and
their own life's insecurities

00:54:07.135 --> 00:54:11.052
and frustrations out on
you, I've disowned you.

00:54:13.288 --> 00:54:16.621
And so you don't have any effects on me.

00:54:18.181 --> 00:54:20.207
And I want those people out there

00:54:20.207 --> 00:54:23.124
that can relate to that to join me.

00:54:25.721 --> 00:54:30.674
There is a mature way to
listen to critiques, criticism,

00:54:30.674 --> 00:54:34.424
feedback, comments,
insight, and information.

00:54:39.256 --> 00:54:43.654
Hurt people will go out of
their way to hurt people.

00:54:43.654 --> 00:54:46.382
Insecure people will go above and beyond

00:54:46.382 --> 00:54:48.299
to create insecurities.

00:54:49.702 --> 00:54:52.743
Negative people will
see to it that you feel

00:54:52.743 --> 00:54:56.237
the negative effects of who they are.

00:54:56.237 --> 00:54:58.874
Haters have a job to do.

00:54:58.874 --> 00:54:59.707
They hate.

00:55:01.551 --> 00:55:04.884
But it doesn't mean
that I'm going to allow

00:55:06.014 --> 00:55:09.181
what your intentions are to affect me.

00:55:11.120 --> 00:55:15.933
I love myself enough to where
I've created a force field

00:55:15.933 --> 00:55:20.213
away from negative people
with negative intentions

00:55:20.213 --> 00:55:21.546
towards my life.

00:55:24.486 --> 00:55:27.403
There's a lot of power in the mind.

00:55:29.784 --> 00:55:32.534
And I'm just asking that you stop

00:55:33.833 --> 00:55:36.833
thinking your way into a depression.

00:55:40.312 --> 00:55:42.562
Your mind is a battlefield.

00:55:44.651 --> 00:55:47.068
Your mind is the battlefield.

00:55:49.321 --> 00:55:52.654
Because there's so much turmoil, trauma,

00:55:54.403 --> 00:55:58.224
and dysfunction playing out in your mind.

00:55:58.224 --> 00:56:02.391
And you're physically experiencing
the effects of your mind.

00:56:03.329 --> 00:56:04.246
Pray on it.

00:56:06.348 --> 00:56:10.515
You can't be stressed,
depressed, miserable, frustrated

00:56:12.730 --> 00:56:16.762
over the things that God
has given you clarity over.

00:56:16.762 --> 00:56:20.845
Of all the things I pray
for, I pray for clarity.

00:56:25.332 --> 00:56:28.153
When I get clarity, it's like a,

00:56:28.153 --> 00:56:30.757
it's a burden that's getting
lift off my shoulders.

00:56:30.757 --> 00:56:35.056
(deep exhale) I understand now.

00:56:35.056 --> 00:56:37.139
I have clarity, I get it.

00:56:38.021 --> 00:56:38.854
Thank you.

00:56:39.765 --> 00:56:42.658
And it doesn't mean that
after you get clarity

00:56:42.658 --> 00:56:45.259
that whatever you're going
through is going to go away,

00:56:45.259 --> 00:56:47.462
but you're going to feel the burden

00:56:47.462 --> 00:56:49.937
and the stress and the
psychological effects

00:56:49.937 --> 00:56:52.907
that it's been having on
you to get lifted off of you

00:56:52.907 --> 00:56:54.990
because you have clarity.

00:56:57.631 --> 00:57:00.548
There's a lot of power in the mind.

00:57:01.913 --> 00:57:04.003
And if you didn't know that, I just wanted

00:57:04.003 --> 00:57:06.170
to make you aware of that.

00:57:09.677 --> 00:57:10.927
I'm very happy.

00:57:13.276 --> 00:57:14.526
I feel the joy.

00:57:16.408 --> 00:57:20.575
Even though my voice is deep
and I seem very serious,

00:57:22.158 --> 00:57:25.325
I've never been more happy in my life.

00:57:26.197 --> 00:57:30.364
And I'm very grateful to have
the mind, body, and spirit

00:57:31.956 --> 00:57:33.944
and the level of clarity that I have.

00:57:33.944 --> 00:57:35.944
It makes my life better.

00:57:37.444 --> 00:57:42.011
I hope somebody out there
received this message.

00:57:42.011 --> 00:57:45.431
Tag whoever needs to see this message.

00:57:45.431 --> 00:57:47.725
I'm fully committed to spreading love

00:57:47.725 --> 00:57:51.531
and spreading whatever insight
and information I have.

00:57:51.531 --> 00:57:54.059
And I'm also clear that
not every message I leave

00:57:54.059 --> 00:57:55.980
is for everybody.

00:57:55.980 --> 00:57:57.710
Take your place.

00:57:57.710 --> 00:57:59.301
Make your mark.

00:57:59.301 --> 00:58:00.551
Live your life.

00:58:01.678 --> 00:58:03.152
Take your place.

00:58:03.152 --> 00:58:04.402
Make your mark.

00:58:06.430 --> 00:58:07.263
Hmm?

00:58:08.647 --> 00:58:10.230
And live your life.

00:58:11.736 --> 00:58:15.044
God didn't bring you in
this world to be average.

00:58:15.044 --> 00:58:18.628
God didn't bring you in this
world to wake up and die

00:58:18.628 --> 00:58:21.530
one day and just be another person

00:58:21.530 --> 00:58:23.356
that lived and died and didn't do

00:58:23.356 --> 00:58:25.747
anything significant in this world.

00:58:25.747 --> 00:58:27.497
Let me say something.

00:58:28.357 --> 00:58:31.085
It's very important
that you listen to this.

00:58:31.085 --> 00:58:33.406
This is a concept that
I created on my own.

00:58:33.406 --> 00:58:35.186
It's called the basement.

00:58:35.186 --> 00:58:36.598
What does that mean?

00:58:36.598 --> 00:58:39.431
It means most of you, most of you,

00:58:44.998 --> 00:58:47.831
you're so consumed with everything

00:58:48.825 --> 00:58:51.697
that's going on in the world.

00:58:51.697 --> 00:58:53.617
This is the reasons
you haven't figured out

00:58:53.617 --> 00:58:55.117
your own life yet.

00:58:56.230 --> 00:58:59.164
Every blog, every website, every tweet,

00:58:59.164 --> 00:59:02.581
every Instagram post, CNN, the news, Fox,

00:59:08.395 --> 00:59:10.242
any and everything that's going on

00:59:10.242 --> 00:59:12.992
in the world, you are so consumed

00:59:13.858 --> 00:59:18.265
with everything that's
going on in the world,

00:59:18.265 --> 00:59:21.543
you're ignoring your own world.

00:59:21.543 --> 00:59:26.173
You can never shine trying
to sit on someone else's sun.

00:59:26.173 --> 00:59:28.878
You can never figure out who you are

00:59:28.878 --> 00:59:32.979
if you're consumed in everything
that everybody else is

00:59:32.979 --> 00:59:35.473
and what they're doing and
the moves that they're making,

00:59:35.473 --> 00:59:37.992
who they're having sex with,
who they're pregnant by,

00:59:37.992 --> 00:59:40.348
who they're dating, who
they went to a club with,

00:59:40.348 --> 00:59:43.378
who bought the most bottles, jewelry,

00:59:43.378 --> 00:59:47.646
clothes, materialistic
things, red bottoms.

00:59:47.646 --> 00:59:50.678
I see all these women out
here wearing red bottoms

00:59:50.678 --> 00:59:54.058
and they broke as hell with no gas money.

00:59:54.058 --> 00:59:56.370
All these dudes out here consumed

00:59:56.370 --> 00:59:58.745
in video games and who they smashing

00:59:58.745 --> 01:00:00.928
and running around with the latest club

01:00:00.928 --> 01:00:03.721
trying to buy bottles
so that the whole club

01:00:03.721 --> 01:00:07.388
can light up and they
over there broke as a.

01:00:08.326 --> 01:00:11.623
Perception creators in the wrong way.

01:00:11.623 --> 01:00:15.764
You're so consumed in
trying to force everyone

01:00:15.764 --> 01:00:18.183
to think and believe
that you're doing it big,

01:00:18.183 --> 01:00:20.850
but we all know that you're not.

01:00:21.798 --> 01:00:22.631
Huh?

01:00:24.516 --> 01:00:28.080
There's a lot of undiscovered
magicians out here

01:00:28.080 --> 01:00:32.419
and they specialize in
whoof, creating the smoke

01:00:32.419 --> 01:00:36.586
and making the world think
that they're doing it big.

01:00:38.344 --> 01:00:41.380
But every night, they go to sleep

01:00:41.380 --> 01:00:45.547
and they're crying silent tears
because you have convinced

01:00:46.540 --> 01:00:49.614
the world that you're doing it big

01:00:49.614 --> 01:00:51.491
and you know you're not doing it big.

01:00:51.491 --> 01:00:54.514
You know that you are
living beyond your means

01:00:54.514 --> 01:00:57.061
and you are frustrated and miserable.

01:00:57.061 --> 01:00:58.643
There is a saying that you have to fake it

01:00:58.643 --> 01:01:02.436
until you make it, but most
of you all have been faking it

01:01:02.436 --> 01:01:06.019
for so long, you're
never going to make it.

01:01:06.019 --> 01:01:08.039
Most of you all have
been faking it so long,

01:01:08.039 --> 01:01:10.706
you now believe your own tricks.

